  "notes": "帮助更近，页面更清爽。\n\n- 新增应用内帮助中心，可离线阅读中英文说明、搜索常见问题。设置页和内核日志页可直接打开相关帮助。\n- 切换标签页后暂停隐藏页面的动画和实时数据显示，返回时恢复。连接期间的今日流量仍持续累计。\n- 首页提醒按优先级显示一条，减少重复提示。设备重置的后果说明保留在确认弹窗中。\n- 遵循系统的减少动画设置，相关页面切换改用淡入淡出。\n- 启动时在后台解析节点清单，减少解析对界面响应的影响，保留原有节点识别与账号切换边界。\n",
  "notesEn": "Help at hand, cleaner pages.\n\n- The new in-app help center provides offline articles in English and Chinese, with search for common questions. Settings and core logs link directly to relevant help.\n- Hidden tabs pause animations and live displays, then resume when selected again. Daily traffic continues counting while connected.\n- The dashboard shows one reminder at a time, chosen by priority. Device reset consequences remain in the confirmation dialog.\n- Page transitions use a fade when the system's reduced motion setting is enabled.\n- Startup parses the node inventory on a worker isolate to reduce its effect on interface responsiveness, while preserving node identity and account change boundaries.\n",
